   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2021-09-30",
   "text": "Federal Big Tech Tort Act\n This bill creates a private right of action against a social media company when an individual under the age of 16 years suffers bodily injury or harm to mental health that is attributable, in whole or in part, to the use of a social media company's website, online application, or mobile application."
  }
